    "title": "Cornell (1).txt: OCR page 4",
    "text": "FOREWORD This report provides information concerning an assistance program for the College of Forestry of the University of the Philippines. It is in three parts. The first part, The Report in Sumroary, presents informa- tion in brief form. The second part, The Final Report, has- broader scope and provides details and explanation. Each of these parts is intended to be independent -- if desired they can be separated. To facilitate inde- pendent use, some of the tabular data are identical in each report and a few written sections are also common . The third section, The Appendices, provide detailed data pert~nt to both reports. Pagination for all three parts is continuous, however. The members of the faculty of State University College of Forestry who participated in the program prepared the report: Professor James E. Davis wrote the major portion of the Final Report; Dr. C. Eugene Farnsworth prepared the prelimillary draft of the Report in Suromary and Appraisal of Results.;. Dean Hardy L. Shirley, Dr. William L. Webb and Dr. Charles C. Larsort ·edited, wrote ·or. rewrote portions and provided constructive criticism. -ii- -",
