    "text": "on of the contract with the College of Agriculture. Professor Guise proposed eight major objectives (see page 7) which were I incorporated into the assistance contract with Cornell University. Although it has been generally agreed by the cooper~ting parties that these objectives were well chosen and provided a satisfactory basis for a contractural opera- I tion, it was 'admitted from the very beginning that some objectives would I",
