    "title": "Cornell (1).txt: OCR page 26",
    "text": "-20·- PROJEGr OBJEGriVES The gener~ go~ of yhe assistance project as def i ned in the State Uni - · versi~y of New York· (SUNY) contract was to strengthen and expand the overall :educational program and rel ated operation of the University of the Philippines . ' in order to meet t he rapidly increasing needs and demands for professional foresters and t rained forestry technicians and t o permit t he University t o provide those services which are expected at a major center of f orest ry education and research. The obj ect ives reco~ended by Prof. Guise following ----- his study of the U. P. College of Forest ry i n 1957 were adopted, wit h minor modifications , as the guidelines f or pursuit of t he general project goal. The contractor has sought specificall y through t echnical guidance and/or assistance t o aid the. College of Forest ry in eight overall tasks of: 1. Modernizing the curriculum. 2. Training faculty members. 3. Improving teaching met hods. 4. Improving student recruitment and increa~~g the number of professional graduat es. 5. Developing effective programs of graduate educatio~, research and public information. 6. Enlarging the physical plant, including the acquisition of instructional and laboratory e~uipment and supplies. 7. Improving college-wide organization and administrative procedures. 8. Strengthening and expanding cooperative relationships of the College with organizations both within and outside the University.",
