    "title": "Cornell (1).txt: OCR page 66",
    "text": "..(:;) .. in J une 1965, USAID continued the tra::L'1ing of participants selec-ted whil e ~ne contract was still in operation and fu~ded f ive faculty members for U. s. t raining starting in late 1965 and early 1966. Thus, some project activity li1itiated under the contract will continue operating for three years following the contract termination .",
    "href": "Cornell (1).txt"
