    "title": "Cornell (1).txt: OCR page 992, part 2",
    "text": "students actually receiving an advanced degree each year compared to total graduate enrollment, but this will increase in the next few years. Progress has been made. There is still more to be done. But it is encouraging as one looks back t o see how great a distance has already been travelled. The road ahead is filled with many challenges, but the faculty capability and their willingness to meet the challenges is inspiring. There is a well-balanced blend of scientific curiosity and desire among the faculty to work with the newly-budding scientists and the future leaders in agriculture - the students. The faculty and students together make an institution, give it its reputation, and lead it to success. -oOo-",
