    "title": "Cornell (1).txt: OCR page 1189",
    "text": "THE FORD FOUNDATION-SUPPORTED UP-CORNELL GRADUATE EDUCATION PROGRAM 7th NARRATIVE ANNUAL REPORT 1969- 70 FAUSTINO T . ORILLO Dean, UP College of Agriculture and MORRILL T . VITTUM UPCO Project Leader, Cornell University UP COLLEGE OF AGRICULTURE College, Laguna Philippines",
    "href": "Cornell (1).txt"
