    "title": "Cornell (1).txt: OCR page 1311",
    "text": "THE FORD FOU~IDATION-SUPPORTED UP-CORNELL GRADUATE EDUCATION PROGRAM 8th NARRATIVE ANNUAL REPORT 1970-71 FAUSTINO T. ORILLO Dean, UP College of. Agriculture and MORRILL T. V!TTill1 UPCO Project Leader, Cornell University UP COLLEGE OF AGRICULTURE College, Laguna Phili'Ppines",
