    "title": "Cornell (1).txt: OCR page 1315",
    "text": "PUBLICATIONS • • • .... 53 FINANCIAL REPORT • . 54 Available Funds • • • . .... 54 Expenditures and Encumbrances . . . .. . . . . 54 LIST OF TABLES Number 1 Graduate school enrollment for the first semester, (1967-71) •..•. 7 2 Foreign Graduate Students by Country • 8 3 Progress of staff training . 28 4 Salary Scales at UP .(as of November 1, 1970) 29 5 Volumes of books in UPCA Library . • • 43 6 Statement of Disbursements and Outstanding Obligations, UPCO Program at Los Banos (as of June 30, 1971) 55 7 UPCA Accounts at Cornell University (June 30, 1971). 56 LIST OF APPENDICES Appendix A UPCA Graduate Student Profile 57 B UPCA Graduate Faculty Profile 60 \\. : v",
