    "title": "Cornell (1).txt: OCR page 1751",
    "text": "CONTENTS Foreword . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . v Introduction ... . .. ................................... , . . vii Summaries of Studies, 1960-1968 1 Classified Index of Studies . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 53 iii",
