    "title": "Cornell (1).txt: OCR page 2088, part 2",
    "text": "Research Service of the USDA has made a long-term projection of supply and demand for selected agricultural products in the Philippines. This shows almost a three-fold increase in consumer demand for processed foods between 1956 and 1975. 1 Excellent statistics are available through the Office or Statistical Coordination and Standards or the National Economic Council and published in The Statistical Reporter. The data quoted here are taken trom articles published in this Journal.",
    "href": "Cornell (1).txt"
