    "title": "Cornell (1).txt: OCR page 2089, part 2",
    "text": "re coconut than a~ other country or the world and this important crop is now threatened b,y a disease known as cadang -cadang • . To meet this problem and others, the government is considering the establishment or a oooonut experiment station. There is an inclination to locate this station in a remote place near the",
