    "title": "Cornell (1).txt: OCR page 2517",
    "text": "- 7 - given le ~tur~ s on tpe .ol owing t opic st l onEffective Oral Communication\" ... addressed to members of ACCI training groupso 01 2o The Business Letter 01 - given at a seminar series of the non- aca demic personnel of the Collegeo 3ouHow to Write Effectivelyu' - given before a group composed of FHDO staff members ~nd field workerso • 10 4o Scientific Reporting''- given before PHILSUGIN staff memberso Aside from extension activities, the Department also carries on activities that fall under community serviceo Such service reflects the course offerings of the Departmento The staff lo translate into English various materials in Spanish and French for the various components of the Los Baffos complex; 20 judge on-and off-campus literary and art contests; 3& edit and proofread undergraduate thesis manuscripts; 4o edit manuscripts for some College staff members and papers and speeches for the Dean's office; So sponsor cultural activities, such as lecture-forums and sympo siums to which guest speakers are invited; 6o serve on College standing and ad hoc committees;and 7o conduct a weekly half-hour program \"Humanities Presents: 10 Horizon s over the College station DZLBo Although the program does large ly community service, its extens ion function is expected to be accomp lished with its projected series of language instruction programs .,",
