    "title": "Cornell (1).txt: OCR page 2615",
    "text": "UNIVERSITY OF THE PHILIPPINES College of Agriculture College, Laguna Philippines (Cabl : AGRICOLL, Manila) FORD FOUNDATION-SPONSORED UP·CORNELL GRADUATE EDU ATION PROGRAM , It bas been a great pleasure t have had ortunity to review the UP .. Cornell Graduate ca · Program during the period January 2 bruary 16 . In due time. the UPCO project lea der' s £fie will be furnishing you sufficient copies of my r port to allow a distribution to the members of the UPCA administration . As I menti on in the report, my visit was not in the capacity as a consultant, but it has been my wish to put on re cord some tangible assessment of the program and i ts needs . You and yo~ staff have given me the highest hospitality during this brief visit. My question• ing baa been extensive , and complete cooperation in supplying answers has been typical, without exception. I wish to congratulate you for developing a College with breadth in its program, quality in its staff, and a forward look to its goals . Your administrators are progressive in thei r outlook and capable of the program dev elopment which m ust be under continual review and updating in a progre s sive College of Agriculture .",
