    "title": "Cornell (1).txt: OCR page 2749, part 2",
    "text": "pact .in their country of assignment will be thr ough speeches, interviews and published articles . Employees in responsible positions are encouraged to speak before informal study and discussion groups ; especially meetings of local specialists and technicians or other pe r sons concer ned with the subject matter in which they specialize . In these discussions and speeches they will have an oppo r tunity to clarify FOA policies and the broad ideals and obj ectives which the United States seeks to obtain through FOA . Ordinarily these speeches will not be given wide publicity but it may be desirable occasionally for officials to make important public addresses intended for wide publication or broadcast .",
